    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22682" root="شفو and شفى" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفَةٌ</span></b> , in which the deficient letter is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>, (K, TA,)
for it has for pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفَوَاتٌ</span>, (TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ه</span>, (K, TA,)
for it has [also] for pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِفَاهٌ</span>, (TA,) has been
mentioned before, (K, TA,) in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شفه</span> [q. v.].
(TA.) ― 
